Hello,

Please contact National Funding. There is still time left to resolve your account. If we do not hear from you, the account will be reported to business credit as a delinquent account and will be referred to our Legal Department for possible litigation. If you are unable to maintain the full payments at this time, we do have modification programs available and would like to work with you to resolve the delinquency. Please contact us at the number below to do so.


Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
